name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-postassessment-q6_2025'

question 'A fitness app shows your total workout minutes for the week. Each time you complete a session, the number on the screen instantly increases. What process connects your new workout time to what you see on the screen?'

wrong 'The app reloads the entire web page from the internet each time you log a workout.'
wrong 'The app saves a screenshot of your old total and replaces it with a new picture.'
wrong 'The app uses a CSS filter to change the color of the text after every session.'
right 'The app updates a variable that stores your total minutes, then changes the DOM to display the new value.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 3
MARKDOWN
